      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***B RATED / 4th FLOOR / TWO BEDROOM / TWO BATHROOM / DESIGNATED PARKING / RECENTLY RENOVATED / SUPERB LOCATION*** \r\n\r\nKELLY BRADSHAW are delighted to present Apartment 284, Parklands, Northwood, Santry, Dublin 9, to the market. This bright and generously proportioned fourth-floor apartment has been recently renovated and combines excellent living space, two well-sized double bedrooms, two bathrooms and a particularly impressive balcony overlooking the surrounding parkland.\r\n\r\nThe apartment has been thoughtfully updated and is presented in excellent condition throughout. Positioned on the fourth floor of this well-established development, No. 284 enjoys a wonderful sense of light and openness, with large windows, neutral décor and warm timber flooring creating a bright and welcoming atmosphere.\r\n\r\nOn entering, a spacious hallway provides access to the accommodation and creates a natural separation between the living and bedroom areas. The hallway also benefits from useful storage, adding to the practicality of the apartment.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan living and dining area is undoubtedly the heart of the home. This well-proportioned room provides ample space for both comfortable living and dining furniture, while large windows fill the room with natural light. Double doors lead directly from the main living area onto the property's impressive balcony.\r\n\r\nThe balcony provides a wonderful extension to the living accommodation and offers pleasant views over the surrounding green spaces. There is ample room for outdoor furniture, making it an ideal spot for morning coffee, outdoor dining or simply relaxing and enjoying the peaceful surroundings.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is positioned conveniently off the main living area and remains connected to the living accommodation while retaining its own defined space. It is fitted with a range of wall and floor-level units, integrated appliances and generous worktop space. Tiled finishes and a window providing natural light complete this practical kitchen area.\r\n\r\nThe apartment features two generous double bedrooms, both offering excellent proportions and ample space for bedroom furniture. The principal bedroom benefits from a private ensuite, complete with shower, W.C. and wash hand basin. The main bathroom is similarly well appointed and features a bath with overhead shower, W.C. and wash hand basin, with tiled finishes completing the space.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property benefits from one designated parking space. The mature landscaped grounds surrounding Parklands provide an attractive setting, with established green spaces and walking routes creating a peaceful environment.\r\n\r\nParklands forms part of the highly regarded Northwood estate and is ideally positioned close to an excellent range of amenities. Northwood Fitness Centre, Northwood Business Campus, the Crowne Plaza Hotel and Gulliver's Retail Park are all within easy reach, while the extensive grounds of Santry Demesne provide an excellent amenity for walking and recreation.\r\n\r\nThe location is exceptionally well connected, with Dublin City Centre approximately 5km away and Dublin Airport just a short drive from the property. The M1, M50 and Dublin Port Tunnel are all readily accessible, making this an excellent location for commuters. There are also regular public transport services providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nApartment 284 offers an excellent combination of space, natural light, contemporary presentation and outdoor living. The recently renovated interior, well-proportioned open-plan living accommodation, generous balcony, two double bedrooms and two bathrooms are complemented by designated parking.\r\n\r\nWhether as a comfortable home or an attractive investment, this is a property that offers excellent practicality in a peaceful yet highly accessible North Dublin setting. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, proportions and setting of this impressive apartment."
